  "description": "Since turning twenty, Jun has the same nightmare every night. In the dream, he is endlessly violated by one man and chased over and over again by countless others. As the dreams grow more vivid, daily life becomes unbearable. Exhausted from lack of sleep, Jun causes an accident and, instead of paying for the repairs, signs a contract to serve the car’s owner for one month. When the man finally appears before him, it is Cain, the very man who violated him in his dreams.\n\n*“Is this your first time?”*\n\nThe man asks the unexpected question as he reaches out and runs his fingers through my hair.\n\n*“Yes.”  \n“Your name?”  \n“Junyo. Han Jun.”*\n\nThe moment I say my name, he suddenly lets out a deep breath. The hand stroking my head slowly brushes my cheek, then trails down to my chest. When his fingers flick my nipple, I grab his hand without even realizing it.\n\n*“You shouldn’t expect me to be gentle.”*\n\nAfter stripping me of even my underwear, he slowly looks over my body as if admiring it, then removes his own robe.\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2313016838), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000092803)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/4421003525), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12587081), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/hunting_dream), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000070740) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://page.kakao.com/content/67073881), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/177804)",
